    <node id="f051e28b2168f8abf28c6b8b27e175990d556aea8c0fa2db2c5dd31d2c440154">
      <data key="d0">Reagan's tenure turned America into the world's biggest debtor nation</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892</data>
    </node>
    <node id="866c313da447b23347d467267a0dff7321d0c49760b01a4a31dcc6960445d07e">
      <data key="d0">enormous trade deficits occurred during Reagan's tenure</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1443d3d0b2600ba77a5a7614b434b2e214e2c73523c7af06656274058242837e">
      <data key="d0">America turned into the world's biggest debtor nation</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892</data>
    </node>
    <node id="352fbd599a6c2070f809fb3ae3ce32892ca10934d4458f9a3207d7e7d48b86ab">
      <data key="d0">There was no mention at all of the Contras, the arms sales to Iran or the enormous trade deficits that during Reagan's tenure have turned America into the world's biggest debtor nation.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d2fb87457c7b8146f6bff7e25dd8ce8e42b1a289129e36734172206422e4d2ed">
      <data key="d0">Contras</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892</data>
    </node>
    <node id="07c020a469ea6bd244a8d04a261b755e592554f9cf6ba1bded8d64c764d5bdf5">
      <data key="d0">Iran</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c82c592ed8eb01039e708151ded713de10959f91f7652ac78ca402759a7338ba">
      <data key="d2">c82c592ed8eb01039e708151ded713de10959f91f7652ac78ca402759a7338ba</data>
      <data key="d0">Israel television rejected a skit by comedian Tuvia Tzafir that attacked public apathy by depicting an Israeli family watching TV while a fire raged outside.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="b3c7e594cbc31a8318634f53592d70193b8f2b6916249465d6ecee32f99da370">
      <data key="d2">b3c7e594cbc31a8318634f53592d70193b8f2b6916249465d6ecee32f99da370</data>
      <data key="d0">An art exhibit at the Hakawati Theatre in Arab east Jerusalem was a series of portraits of Palestinians killed in the rebellion.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="dfa77a6a9313b8d0374a65d76e75e485b439d3410b4020d1f02d98f82d4a935d">
      <data key="d2">dfa77a6a9313b8d0374a65d76e75e485b439d3410b4020d1f02d98f82d4a935d</data>
      <data key="d0">PERUGIA, Italy (AP)</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="eb024aa9f5f8f1b64ddd17013b2ad7fd571771d6fb622829b2bf6dda31208c7f">
      <data key="d2">eb024aa9f5f8f1b64ddd17013b2ad7fd571771d6fb622829b2bf6dda31208c7f</data>
      <data key="d0">Officials in Perugia in Umbria province said five people were arrested there Tuesday night after police stopped their car and found $1 million in bogus bills in the trunk.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="778114f6461d7f003718c8fe7bda7cfdac91f9745032bb1195bbdbbcab452c29">
      <data key="d2">778114f6461d7f003718c8fe7bda7cfdac91f9745032bb1195bbdbbcab452c29</data>
      <data key="d0">The ANSA news agency said the operation involved police in Umbria and Lazio provinces in central Italy and Campania province in the south, without specifying exact arrest locations.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="4c1ec9804433c51b1df6966d6503464202ece20f045a2a58c296a0756b08babd">
      <data key="d2">4c1ec9804433c51b1df6966d6503464202ece20f045a2a58c296a0756b08babd</data>
      <data key="d0">Rome is in Lazio province and Naples in Campania.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="bf0ffc4164efde457aaed251b40b5c7521627e97033ba8278c2208e778eb330e">
      <data key="d2">bf0ffc4164efde457aaed251b40b5c7521627e97033ba8278c2208e778eb330e</data>
      <data key="d0">Reagan sounded positive notes reminiscent of earlier speeches throughout his political career _ the pre-eminent position of "We the People" in the American system, the image of America as a shining "city upon a hill," the importance of paying more attention to American history.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e479537c5365984b66cdea825ddaeba004eb98f778334b1b7a4754362a74a8ba">
      <data key="d2">e479537c5365984b66cdea825ddaeba004eb98f778334b1b7a4754362a74a8ba</data>
      <data key="d0">There was no mention of the "iron triangle" of members of Congress, the news media and special interest groups who, in a speech to political appointees in Washington on Dec. 13, Reagan claimed had prevented his administration from balancing the federal budget.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="65ff1eed3f4798029514b1b8e826b6d0e22c1982f56fdff8fee6c40cce016ea7">
      <data key="d2">65ff1eed3f4798029514b1b8e826b6d0e22c1982f56fdff8fee6c40cce016ea7</data>
      <data key="d0">Nor did he argue, as he did in a speech at the University of Virginia in Charlottesville Dec. 16, that Congress had perpetuated a dangerous situation in Central America by its "on-again, off-again indecisiveness" on his program of aid to the anti-communist Contra rebels.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892">
      <data key="d2">c2bdb8f0f4f1e48dfca6549593e44a201cda817b234aaaa5d16ad43483ea4892</data>
      <data key="d0">There was no mention at all of the Contras, the arms sales to Iran or the enormous trade deficits that during Reagan's tenure have turned America into the world's biggest debtor nation.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
